OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 MAR
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GThe BBC National Orchestra and
OL,9,     GChorus of Wales and conductor
OL,10,     GMichal Nesterowicz perform
OL,11,     GGorecki's Three Pieces in Old
OL,12,     GStyle, Poulenc's Gloria, and
OL,13,     GDvorak's 8th Symphony.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: Music Rediscovered -
OL,15,     Fseries 2
OL,16,     GDomenico Corri's luxury song book
OL,17,     Gpioneered an innovative way of
OL,18,     Gannotating, which allows us to
OL,19,     Gunderstand singing performances
OL,20,     Gfrom the 1780s. Brianna Robertson-
OL,21,     GKirkland explains.
