OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 MAR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto's guest this week is the
OL,12,     Grenowned British jazz saxophonist
OL,13,     GIain Ballamy, who is sharing some
OL,14,     Gof the albums that have
OL,15,     Ginfluenced him for our feature.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GOrchestra della Svizzera Italiana
OL,18,     Gand conductor Alessandro Cadario
OL,19,     Gare joined by marimba player
OL,20,     GMatthias Wursch in Ney Rosauro's
OL,21,     GConcerto no 1 for Marimba and
OL,22,     GString Orchestra.
